A lightweight Python CLI powered by **uv**, **Cyclopts**, **Rich**, **Ruff**, and **pytest**.

## Get started

Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/), then:

```sh
uv sync
uv run {{ project_name }} --help
uv run {{ project_name }} greet Ada
```

Each project has its own `.venv` managed by uv. Commit `uv.lock` after the first `uv sync`.

## Development

```sh
uv run pytest -q
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run ruff format .
uv build
```

The CLI entry point is `src/{{ project_name | replace('-', '_') }}/cli.py`. Put reusable logic in separate modules, and write a failing test before changing behavior. See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for agent conventions.

## Template updates

